{"id":112,"verses":[{"number":1,"arabicText":" قُلْ هُوَ ٱللَّهُ أَحَدٌ","transliteration":"Qul huwa l-lahu aḥad","translation":"Say, ˹O Prophet,˺ “He is Allah—One ˹and Indivisible˺"},{"number":2,"arabicText":"ٱللَّهُ ٱلصَّمَدُ","transliteration":"Al-lahu ṣ-ṣamad","translation":"Allah—the Sustainer ˹needed by all˺"},{"number":3,"arabicText":"لَمْ يَلِدْ وَلَمْ يُولَدْ","transliteration":"Lam yalid walam yūlad","translation":"He has never had offspring, nor was He born"},{"number":4,"arabicText":"وَلَمْ يَكُن لَّهُۥ كُفُوًا أَحَدٌۢ","transliteration":"Walam yakul-lahu kufuwan aḥad","translation":"And there is none comparable to Him.”"}]}